# Monthly Operations Report – August 2026

**Period:** August 1, 2026 – August 31, 2026  
**Status:** Completed (Monitoring Flag Active)

## 1. Executed Tasks
- **System-Wide Updates**: Applied the latest stable updates to all network equipment, workstations, and servers.
- **Configuration Backups**: Performed a complete save of all current configurations and critical data. Everything is backed up to date.
