- **Observation**: This behavior was not present in previous months. The frequent reboots suggest a potential issue with the power supply unit (PSU) or internal stability.

## 3. Action Points & Recommendations
- **Active Monitoring**: The switch will be closely monitored over the next few weeks.
- **Contingency Plan**: If the power cycling repeats or any instability is detected in September, a thorough, detailed diagnostic will be initiated. This includes deep log analysis, hardware stress testing, and potentially replacing the PSU or the unit itself.

## 4. Overall Status
Aside from the monitored switch behavior, the entire infrastructure remained stable and operational throughout August. All systems are secure, patched, and backed up. We are prepared to escalate the switch investigation if necessary in September.
